        ],
        [
          "text-indent",
          "22.5pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Over the last decade, our research teams have pushed the boundaries of AI forward, which is displayed through Gemini 3, our most intelligent AI model yet. Designed to deliver advanced multimodal understanding, Gemini 3 represents our most capable iteration of agentic and generative coding technologies. Gemini 3 integrates enhanced reasoning capabilities to support visualizations and interactive user experiences across our product ecosystem, including Search and the Gemini app.",
      "text_hash": "cb9cb3f3a70d2f53a18b0e615d3e298fcd5d8df9a0b6c117d74a64dd322108a0",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000074-05305a43",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[81]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 74,
      "reported_page": 4,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "'arial',sans-serif"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "font-weight",
          "400"
        ],
        [
          "line-height",
          "120%"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "6pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ],
        [
          "text-indent",
          "22.5pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "As technology continues to improve rapidly, we are focused on bringing our latest AI advances to our products and platforms. We continue to help our users access information and knowledge, express themselves, and get things done by embedding the power of generative AI and Gemini into our products and platforms. Today, all 15 of our half-billion-user products — including seven with two billion users — use our Gemini models. For our Google Cloud customers, our offerings are helping organizations stay at the forefront of innovation with solutions such as Gemini Enterprise and Gemini for Google Workspace.",
      "text_hash": "05305a43aabf512c56de8da598c68144782d7c37222de012a763b08783081c25",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000075-bfd47c66",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[82]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 75,
      "reported_page": 4,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": [
